  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><h2>About our brand and products:</h2><p><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://swimmingwithconfidence.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Swimming with Confidence</a><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>helps parents confidently teach their children how to swim through play-based, USA Swimming-inspired tools and resources. Our products include Swim Lessons in a Box, water safety guides, swim lesson tools, goggles, and parent-friendly educational resources designed to make learning to swim less overwhelming and more accessible for families.</p><h2>What makes us different:</h2><p>We focus on empowering parents instead of replacing them. Our approach combines water safety, confidence-building, and structured swim progression in a customizable, family-centered system that helps children build positive relationships with the water through fun, connection, and consistency.</p><h2>How affiliates can earn:</h2><p>Affiliates earn commissions by sharing Swimming with Confidence products and resources with their audience through custom affiliate links and discount codes. As our platform continues to grow, affiliates may also benefit from seasonal promotions, product launches, bundle campaigns, and increased exposure through our larger SWC ecosystem.</p><h2>How to promote us:</h2><p>Affiliates can promote Swimming with Confidence through social media posts, videos, blogs, email marketing, product reviews, water safety education, and authentic storytelling. Content that highlights family experiences, water confidence, swim progress, and the importance of water safety and FUN tends to resonate best with our audience.</p><h2>Other information:</h2><p>Swimming with Confidence is more than a swim company — we are building a family-focused water safety and swim education platform designed to support families everywhere. We value partnerships built on trust, shared mission, quality products, and creating positive experiences that help families love the water together.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div>",
