  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Affiliate Terms &amp; Conditions</span></strong></span></h2><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Welcome to the Swimming with Confidence Affiliate Program — we’re glad you’re here.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">By joining, you agree to the following:</span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>1. Joining the Program</strong></span></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">We reserve the right to approve or remove affiliates at any time to ensure the program stays aligned with our brand and values.</span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>2. Affiliate Links &amp; Promotion</strong></span></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">You will receive a unique affiliate link (and possibly a coupon code) to share.</span></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">You can link to our homepage or specific products</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">You may promote through social media, email, or other platforms</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Please represent our products honestly and accurately</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">If multiple affiliate links are clicked, the most recent link will be credited.</span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>3. Commissions</strong></span></h3><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Affiliates earn commission on qualifying purchases made through their link or code</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Commission rates typically range from <strong>10%–30%</strong>, depending on performance, promotions, or special partnerships</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Commission is calculated based on product value only (excluding taxes, shipping, and additional fees)</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Some products may be excluded from commissions, including select partner or third-party items</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Current commission rates and eligibility can always be viewed in your affiliate dashboard</li></ul><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>4. Payments</strong></span></h3><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Payments are issued after successful transactions are completed</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Orders that are refunded, canceled, or disputed will not be paid out</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">You are responsible for providing accurate payment information</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">We reserve the right to review and adjust commissions in cases of refunds, misuse, or unusual activity.</span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>5. Cookies &amp; Tracking</strong></span></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">We use cookies to track referrals.</span></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">If cookies are disabled or cleared, tracking may not work</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Cookie duration is outlined on the affiliate signup page</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Purchases made within that timeframe may be credited to you</li></ul><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>6. Acceptable Use</strong></span></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Affiliates may not:</span></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Make false or misleading claims</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Use spam or unsolicited messaging</li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Run ads using our brand name without permission</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">Affiliates are responsible for following applicable laws and guidelines, including properly disclosing affiliate relationships when promoting products.</span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>7. Leaving the Program</strong></span></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">You may leave the program at any time by contacting:<br></span><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;\">support@swimmingwithconfidence.com</span></a></p></div>",
